option "title" "So Cai Ke Toan Nam Phong 2026"
option "operating_currency" "VND"

; Khai báo danh mục tài khoản theo Chuẩn mực Kế toán VN (TT 200)
2026-01-01 open Assets:Bank:VCB                      VND ; TK 1121 - Tien gui ngan hang VCB
2026-01-01 open Assets:Cash                          VND ; TK 1111 - Tien mat
2026-01-01 open Assets:Receivable:Customers          VND ; TK 131  - Phai thu khach hang
2026-01-01 open Assets:Tax:VATInput                  VND ; TK 1331 - Thue GTGT dau vao duoc khau tru
2026-01-01 open Liabilities:Payable:Suppliers        VND ; TK 331  - Phai tra nguoi ban
2026-01-01 open Liabilities:Tax:VATOutput            VND ; TK 33311- Thue GTGT dau ra phai nop
2026-01-01 open Equity:OpeningBalances               VND ; TK 411  - Von dau tu chu so huu
2026-01-01 open Income:Sales                         VND ; TK 511  - Doanh thu ban hang
2026-01-01 open Expenses:OfficeSupplies              VND ; TK 642  - Chi phi quan ly (thiet bi, phan mem)
2026-01-01 open Expenses:CostOfGoodsSold             VND ; TK 632  - Gia von hang ban

; Số dư đầu kỳ
2026-10-01 * "So du dau ky" "Nap tien gui ngan hang dau ky"
  Assets:Bank:VCB                    100000000 VND
  Equity:OpeningBalances            -100000000 VND

; Nghiệp vụ 1: Mua phần mềm kế toán và chữ ký số theo HĐ C26TCC 0000888
2026-10-17 * "Cong ty Phan mem Ke toan Pro" "Hoa don 0000888 - Mua phan mem va chu ky so"
  Expenses:OfficeSupplies             15000000 VND
  Assets:Tax:VATInput                  1500000 VND
  Liabilities:Payable:Suppliers      -16500000 VND

; Nghiệp vụ 2: Chuyển khoản ngân hàng thanh toán cho nhà cung cấp
2026-10-17 * "Vietcombank" "Uy nhiem chi thanh toan HD 0000888"
  Liabilities:Payable:Suppliers       16500000 VND
  Assets:Bank:VCB                    -16500000 VND

; Nghiệp vụ 3: Cung cấp dịch vụ thu tiền qua ngân hàng (Doanh thu 30tr, VAT 3tr)
2026-10-17 * "Khach hang A" "Cung cap dich vu phan mem ky 1"
  Assets:Bank:VCB                     33000000 VND
  Income:Sales                       -30000000 VND
  Liabilities:Tax:VATOutput           -3000000 VND
